{"version":1,"content":"<p>據英國《金融時報》報道，戴爾、慧與、聯想和超微等主要伺服器廠商，被指在與客户就AI伺服器採購價格達成初步協議後，仍在數月內大幅上調最終售價。部分訂單的加價幅度據稱可達25%、30%，甚至45%，而客户往往只能接受，因為數據中心建設對算力硬件的需求極為迫切。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587722.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T20:00:27.169470+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T19:41:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T19:53:30.182217+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T19:53:30.182217+00:00","content_hash":"a5890628b43df6e92be6c41dca280c9ec4f616146a60f8dc20c4c4993399dabe","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}